  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FMint%20Fudge.png\" title=\"Mint Fudge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mint Fudge\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Mint Fudge</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 102</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 522</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  2 h 30 m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 62</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Fudge Shop</span><span title=\"Fudge shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/fudge-shop-35377\" title=\"Fudge Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fudge Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 145</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 h 7 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Mint Fudge</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 102.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making mint fudge</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FFudge%20Shop.png\" title=\"Fudge Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fudge Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"168\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Fudge Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Mint Fudge is made in the <a href=\"/wiki/fudge-shop-35377\" title=\"Fudge Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fudge Shop</a>.\n</p><p>To make the mint fudge, players need the following ingredient, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cabbage-34832\" title=\"Butter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Butter\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cacao-2248\" title=\"Cacao\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cacao\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/white-sugar-2096\" title=\"White sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White sugar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/mint-29903\" title=\"Mint\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mint\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 2 hours 30 minutes to make one serving, and 2 hours and 7 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> shop. Each serving gives players 62 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling mint fudge</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Mint fudge can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,220 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 servings.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make the mint fudge costs 482 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 mint fudge per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-fudge-shop-products-35428\" title=\"Category:Fudge Shop Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fudge Shop Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chili-fudge-35381\" title=\"Chili Fudge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chili Fudge\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-fudge-35382\" title=\"Lemon Fudge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon Fudge\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/mint-fudge-35380\" title=\"Mint Fudge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mint Fudge\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/peanut-fudge-35383\" title=\"Peanut Fudge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peanut Fudge\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/rich-fudge-35378\" title=\"Rich Fudge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rich Fudge\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831004517\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 992/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5639/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 757/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 934989/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   83.458      1 -total\n 72.71%   60.679      1 Template:Infobox\n 31.89%   26.614      9 Template:Infoicon\n 18.38%   15.338      1 Template:Navigation\n 11.62%    9.702      1 Template:FudgeShopMenu\n  3.10%    2.589      1 Template:Languages\n  1.81%    1.509      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  1.52%    1.265      4 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved